0..78 Comment "// Divergence as a row entry (#1481). A loop the checker cannot see out of may"
79..155 Comment "// run forever, so the function holding it states `Div` in its row: the host"
156..235 Comment "// interface with no operation, which no handler eliminates. A caller of such a"
236..312 Comment "// function holds `Div` in its own row, as it holds any interface its callee"
313..389 Comment "// performs, so a function at the empty row returns. A call that returns and"
390..468 Comment "// whose result nothing reads is the computation that follows it. What refuses"
469..524 Comment "// is in `../../pathological/control/divergence.gandr`."
526..603 Comment "/// A loop that breaks only when one is below zero: it never returns, and its"
604..628 Comment "/// row says it may not."
